OL,3,ABurnham says existing pension triple
OL,4,Alock will end in 2030 to help fund
OL,5,Anational care service
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham says the government will
OL,8,Fend the existing pensions "triple lock"
OL,9,Ffrom 2030 to help fund adult social
OL,10,Fcare reforms in England
OL,12,FThe triple lock means the state pension
OL,13,Fcurrently increases annually in line
OL,14,Fwith inflation, average wage growth, or
OL,15,F2.5% - whichever is highest
OL,17,FBut, from April 2030, the annual
OL,18,Fearnings link will be dropped - the
OL,19,Fgovernment thinks this could save #15bn
OL,20,Fa year by 2040
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,108,105,200,300,0,100
